OL,3,AGhana's new $60m presidential jet
OL,4,Asparks public outrage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe controversy comes as Mahama's
OL,7,Fadministration seeks to demonstrate an
OL,8,Feconomic recovery after years of
OL,9,Ffinancial difficulties that forced
OL,10,FGhana to seek IMF assistance.
